stream
BT /F2 15 Tf 49 754.0 Td (BEYOND CHATBOTS - OCTOBER 10, 2026) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 49 730.0 Td (Slides 1-14 - presentation cues) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.2 Tf 49 712.0 Td (PART 1 - SET UP THE QUESTION) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 696.0 Td (Slide 1 - Beyond Chatbots \(0:00-0:45\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 684.0 Td ("Good afternoon. I'm the founder of Kira Labs. Today I want to show how we can test whether an AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 672.3 Td (remembers correctly, keeps identities separate, and reports what actually happened.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 656.6 Td (Slide 2 - Continuity \(0:45-2:00\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 644.6 Td ("Imagine Kira sees a blue cup. Lisa never entered the room. Lisa may learn about the cup from Kira, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 632.9 Td (must not remember personally seeing it.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 617.2 Td (Slide 3 - Model and retained state \(2:00-3:15\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 605.2 Td ("A language model, temporary chat context, and saved memories are different things. We need to know what) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 593.5 Td (survives a restart and who owns it.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 577.8 Td (Slide 4 - Kira World \(3:15-4:30\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 565.8 Td ("Kira World is the planned home for distinct synthetic identities in digital spaces. They can share) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 554.1 Td (software, but their personal histories should remain separate.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 538.4 Td (Slide 5 - Identity isolation \(4:30-5:45\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 526.4 Td ("Someone may receive another person's report without acquiring that person's first-hand experience.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 510.7 Td (Slide 6 - Corrections \(5:45-7:00\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 498.7 Td ("If we discover the cup was green, the current answer should change, and the correction should have a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 487.0 Td (source. Privacy and deletion rules still matter.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 471.3 Td (Slide 7 - Origins \(7:00-8:15\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 459.3 Td ("An observation, report, guess, and dream are not the same kind of evidence. A trustworthy memory system) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 447.6 Td (keeps them separate.") Tj ET
BT /F2 10.2 Tf 49 431.9 Td (PART 2 - SHOW THE RESULTS) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 415.9 Td (Slide 8 - Held and failed work \(8:15-9:30\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 403.9 Td ("Saving a video request is not the same as finishing a video. Systems must distinguish requested, held,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 392.2 Td (running, finished, and uncertain work.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 376.5 Td (Slide 9 - Receipts \(9:30-10:45\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 364.5 Td ("If a task finishes but confirmation is lost, blindly retrying can duplicate it. We need an operation ID) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 352.8 Td (and a verifiable receipt.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 337.1 Td (Slide 10 - Test protocol \(10:45-12:00\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 325.1 Td ("Don't judge an AI by one impressive example. Compare fair tasks, strong simple controls, and recorded) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 313.4 Td (failures.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 297.7 Td (Slide 11 - Five-seed review retention \(12:00-14:00\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 285.7 Td ("Our small command learner retained all old and new examples with review across five repeated trials.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 274.0 Td (That's a narrow finding, not proof of general conversation.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 258.3 Td (Slide 12 - Visual failure \(14:00-15:40\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 246.3 Td ("This experiment failed: the learner memorized training images but scored zero on new color-and-shape) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 234.6 Td (combinations. Failures tell us what needs work.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 218.9 Td (Slide 13 - Resource measurements \(15:40-17:30\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 206.9 Td ("This tiny command model uses little memory for its task, but it has not been shown to outperform a full) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 195.2 Td (Qwen conversation model.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 179.5 Td (Slide 14 - October 8 update \(17:30-18:50\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 167.5 Td ("All four migration-preservation reviews passed. One delayed restart ran, but zero restart results are) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 155.8 Td (independently accepted. The saved static body rig reopens correctly; real movement and reliable general) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 144.1 Td (memory are unfinished.") Tj ET
BT /F1 7.9 Tf 49 128.4 Td (Kira Labs | Check latest status for changes after October 8, 2026.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 552 29 Td (1) Tj ET
endstream
