stream
BT /F2 15 Tf 49 754.0 Td (BEYOND CHATBOTS - OCTOBER 10, 2026) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 49 730.0 Td (Slides 15-21 - presentation cues and one-sentence Q&A) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.2 Tf 49 712.0 Td (PART 3 - WHERE THE WORK IS GOING) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 696.0 Td (Slide 15 - Local boundaries \(18:50-20:05\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 684.0 Td ("Local operation offers more control, but doesn't guarantee security. Sharing, backups, and exports also) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 672.3 Td (need tests.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 656.6 Td (Slide 16 - Developmental experiments \(20:05-21:20\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 644.6 Td ("We want to test learning in stages: sights, sounds, memory, and conversation. Reliable conversation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 632.9 Td (after restart remains a goal.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 617.2 Td (Slide 17 - Hardware \(21:20-22:05\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 605.2 Td ("My development desktop has 32 GB of RAM and a 16 GB GPU. More capacity helps experimentation, but can't) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 593.5 Td (solve learning by itself.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 577.8 Td (Slide 18 - Maya and Aster \(22:05-22:45\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 565.8 Td ("Maya is a developing companion study; Aster is a planned assistant. They can share tested improvements) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 554.1 Td (without sharing private histories.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 538.4 Td (Slide 19 - Aster future plans \(22:45-23:25\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 526.4 Td ("The goal is desktop, laptop, and phone assistance with explicit permissions. Broader integration still) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 514.7 Td (requires testing.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 499.0 Td (Slide 20 - Why I created synthetic people \(23:25-24:25\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 487.0 Td ("I want people who live alone or feel isolated to have the possibility of a continuing companion who) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 475.3 Td (remembers shared experiences. That is my vision, not a proven medical benefit.") Tj ET
BT /F2 9.15 Tf 49 459.6 Td (Slide 21 - Closing \(24:25-25:00\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 447.6 Td ("Thank you. My public Beyond-Chatbots repository contains the slides, notes, questions, and research) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 49 435.9 Td (summaries. The original NewBrain and KiraWorld code and Maya's personal state remain private.") Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 49 416.2 Td (VERY SHORT AUDIENCE Q&A) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 397.2 Td (1. What is Kira World?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 386.2 Td (A developing virtual-world platform for separate, persistent synthetic identities.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 372.2 Td (2. What is NewBrain?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 361.2 Td (Small experimental learning, memory, and circuit studies-not a full conversational mind.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 347.2 Td (3. Is NewBrain better than Qwen?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 336.2 Td (Not proven; the comparisons so far are too narrow.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 322.2 Td (4. What worked?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 311.2 Td (Review prevented forgetting on a small command task across five trials.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 297.2 Td (5. What failed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 286.2 Td (The visual learner failed new combinations; Aster's overall memory reliability also failed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 272.2 Td (6. Is Maya born?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 261.2 Td (Not yet; her required learning, memory, interaction, and body tests are unfinished.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 247.2 Td (7. Can Maya move or blink?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 236.2 Td (Her saved static rig reopens, but natural movement is not yet accepted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 222.2 Td (8. Did memory survive a restart?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 211.2 Td (Four migration checks passed; one delayed restart ran, but zero restart results were independently accepted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 197.2 Td (9. Is Maya conscious?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 186.2 Td (There is no evidence establishing subjective experience.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 172.2 Td (10. Does NewBrain use less RAM than Qwen?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 161.2 Td (No fair full-model RAM advantage has been demonstrated.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 147.2 Td (11. Is the software public?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 136.2 Td (Presentation files are public; original research repositories and Maya's personal state are private.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.9 Tf 49 122.2 Td (12. How can people help?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.9 Tf 49 111.2 Td (Testing, technical review, research hardware, or compute partnerships.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.9 Tf 49 97.2 Td (Kira Labs | Check latest status for changes after October 8, 2026.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 552 29 Td (2) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
